1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,440
The shepherd boy had been watching sheep all day, and he was terribly bored.

2
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,672
Suddenly, he had an idea.

3
00:00:09,672 --> 00:00:12,168
Wolf! Wolf!

4
00:00:12,168 --> 00:00:15,912
The villagers rushed up the hill as quickly as they could.

5
00:00:15,912 --> 00:00:17,640
The boy couldn't stop laughing.

6
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:21,552
A few days later, the same idea came to his mind again.

7
00:00:21,552 --> 00:00:24,048
Wolf! Wolf!

8
00:00:24,048 --> 00:00:27,120
Once again, the villagers hurried up the hill.

9
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,872
The boy laughed even harder.

10
00:00:28,872 --> 00:00:33,312
This time, however, a real wolf appeared behind the sheep.

11
00:00:33,312 --> 00:00:35,808
Wolf! Wolf!

12
00:00:35,808 --> 00:00:39,816
Before long, the villagers arrived with everything they needed.

13
00:00:39,816 --> 00:00:43,824
The frightened wolf quickly ran back into the forest.

14
00:00:43,824 --> 00:00:46,656
The sheep were safe because everyone was ready.

15
00:00:46,656 --> 00:00:51,432
The moral is... Practice prepares people for real emergencies.
